OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'taken too soon' as husband
OL,4,Acharged with murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family has paid tribute to a their
OL,7,Fmother who they said "had many years
OL,8,Fahead of her" after her husband was
OL,9,Fcharged with her murder.
OL,11,FAnnette Bishop, 71, was found seriously
OL,12,Finjured and pronounced dead at a
OL,13,Fproperty on Sherbourne Avenue in
OL,14,FBradley Stoke, Bristol, at about 14:00
OL,15,FBST on Friday.
OL,17,FHer husband, 73-year-old Gerald Bishop,
OL,18,Fof Sherbourne Avenue, has been charged
OL,19,Fwith her murder and will go on trial at
OL,20,FBristol Crown Court on 5 April next
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
